00:38:52.593 --> 00:38:54.260
As long as you know
at your company what

00:38:54.260 --> 00:38:58.190
sensitive data means, then
it's great to use such a tool.

00:38:58.190 --> 00:39:02.360
But the first thing is to define
what the sensitive data is,

00:39:02.360 --> 00:39:04.610
