once you have such a tool.

00:39:07.970 --> 00:39:12.850
The second one is related
to maybe more mobility.

00:39:12.850 --> 00:39:15.770
And we have such a project
within our company.

00:39:15.770 --> 00:39:17.690
Secure anytime,
anywhere, any device.

00:39:17.690 --> 00:39:19.020
