00:39:19.020 --> 00:39:22.690
And I'm talking about
context aware access.

00:39:22.690 --> 00:39:25.640
And you can authorize
some people to access,

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:29.220
according to a certain
context, to some resources.

00:39:29.220 --> 00:39:31.400
And this is also
a very great tool

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:36.050
