domain-wide delegation.

00:40:07.000 --> 00:40:09.980
So again, at a
company like ours,

00:40:09.980 --> 00:40:12.140
it means accessing
the whole domain.

00:40:12.140 --> 00:40:15.830
So we would like more
granular things like this.

00:40:15.830 --> 00:40:18.040
Another tool we
could be great, we

00:40:18.040 --> 00:40:21.138
discussed before
sensitive accounts.

00:40:21.138 --> 00:40:22.680
Super admin accounts
is one category.

00:40:22.680 --> 00:40:25.790
But we have also all
the delegated admins.

00:40:25.790 --> 00:40:28.220
And we have customized role.

00:40:28.220 --> 00:40:31.580
And one of the problems is
that some they use some roles,

00:40:31.580 --> 00:40:33.420
