just in one click.

00:41:11.550 --> 00:41:13.550
So it would be great to
have a report right away

00:41:13.550 --> 00:41:16.290
to say, oh guy, look, your
configuration is exactly

00:41:16.290 --> 00:41:17.370
like this.

00:41:17.370 --> 00:41:18.550
Should I carry on, Andrew?

